{"id":"fana_tico","lemma":"fanático","pos":"noun","rank":4282,"glosses":["fanatic","fan","zealot"],"ipa":"/faˈnatiko/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"fanáticos","feminine":"fanática","femininePlural":"fanáticas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/66/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-fan%C3%A1tico.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es un fanático.","en":"He's a bigot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/702953","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Soy un gran fanático del arte.","en":"I am a big fan of the arts.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"art"}]},{"text":"Había muchos fanáticos entusiasmados en el estadio.","en":"There were a lot of excited fans in the stadium.","words":[{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null,{"g":"enthusiastic, enthused","l":"entusiasmado"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"stadium"}]},{"text":"Él es un fanático de la ciencia ficción.","en":"He's a science fiction fanatic.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"],[6,8,"science fiction"]]},{"text":"Tom es un fanático.","en":"Tom is a zealot.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}